# internal_cosmogenics_rd.mac
#
# Raise the G4RadioactiveDecay time threshold to 1e5 s, which covers 41Ar
# (T1/2 = 6600 s), 38Cl (2234 s), 39Cl (3300 s) and everything shorter.
# Geological-scale isotopes (39Ar, 36Cl, 35S, 37Ar) stay far above it and are
# still treated as stable.
#
# The unit is REQUIRED. A bare number is rejected by Geant4 with
# "***** Illegal parameter (1) *****" and the threshold is left unset -- which
# is silent unless the g4 log is read.
/process/had/rdm/thresholdForVeryLongDecayTime 1.0e+14 ns
